ns that need addressing. Provide evidence: B very conscientious, handles stress well, good at assessing weather, excellent computer skills. Concerns: weak memory for numbers, makes nasty remarks. Explain impact on reliability and crew cooperation. Conclude still recommend B but we need mitigation. So produce public message referencing earlier contributions (Agent 1 and 3). Provide metadata vote Candidate B."}
